{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"歷代志上","commonName":"歷代志上","title":"歷代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"a668b4b6547e2ee24f3b6e74327236fef85ba56c9634c2dd8acf5b518e6a27b8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":939},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["便雅憫的後裔"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["便雅憫的長子比拉，次子亞實別，三子亞哈拉，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["四子挪哈，五子拉法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["比拉的兒子是亞大、基拉、亞比忽、"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["亞比書、乃幔、亞何亞、"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["基拉、示孚汛、戶蘭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["以忽的兒子作迦巴居民的族長，被擄到瑪拿轄；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["以忽的兒子乃幔、亞希亞、基拉也被擄去。基拉生烏撒、亞希忽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["沙哈連休他二妻戶伸和巴拉之後，在摩押地生了兒子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他與妻賀得同房，生了約巴、洗比雅、米沙、瑪拉干、"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶烏斯、沙迦、米瑪。他這些兒子都是族長。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他的妻戶伸給他生的兒子有亞比突、以利巴力。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["以利巴力的兒子是希伯、米珊、沙麥。沙麥建立阿挪和羅德二城與其村莊。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["在亞雅崙的便雅憫人"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["又有比利亞和示瑪是亞雅崙居民的族長，是驅逐迦特人的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["亞希約、沙煞、耶利末、"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["西巴第雅、亞拉得、亞得、"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["米迦勒、伊施巴、約哈都是比利亞的兒子。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["在耶路撒冷的便雅憫人"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["西巴第雅、米書蘭、希西基、希伯、"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["伊施米萊、伊斯利亞、約巴都是以利巴力的兒子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["雅金、細基利、撒底、"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["以利乃、洗勒太、以列、"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["亞大雅、比拉雅、申拉都是示每的兒子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["伊施班、希伯、以列、"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["亞伯頓、細基利、哈難、"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["哈拿尼雅、以攔、安陀提雅、"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["伊弗底雅、毗努伊勒都是沙煞的兒子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["珊示萊、示哈利、亞他利雅、"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["雅利西、以利亞、細基利都是耶羅罕的兒子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["這些人都是著名的族長，住在耶路撒冷。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["在基遍和耶路撒冷的便雅憫人"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["在基遍住的有基遍的父親耶利。他的妻名叫瑪迦；"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["他長子是亞伯頓。他又生蘇珥、基士、巴力、拿答、"]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["基多、亞希約、撒迦、米基羅。"]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":["米基羅生示米暗。這些人和他們的弟兄在耶路撒冷對面居住。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["掃羅王的家族"]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":["尼珥生基士；基士生掃羅；掃羅生約拿單、麥基舒亞、亞比拿達、伊施‧巴力。"]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":["約拿單的兒子是米力‧巴力",{"noteId":8},"；米力‧巴力生米迦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":["米迦的兒子是毗敦、米勒、他利亞、亞哈斯；"]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":["亞哈斯生耶何阿達；耶何阿達生亞拉篾、亞斯瑪威、心利；心利生摩撒；"]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":["摩撒生比尼亞；比尼亞的兒子是拉法；拉法的兒子是以利亞薩；以利亞薩的兒子是亞悉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":["亞悉有六個兒子，他們的名字是亞斯利干、波基路、以實瑪利、示亞利雅、俄巴底雅、哈難。這都是亞悉的兒子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":["亞悉兄弟以設的長子是烏蘭，次子耶烏施，三子是以利法列。"]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":["烏蘭的兒子都是大能的勇士，是弓箭手，他們有許多的子孫，共一百五十名，都是便雅憫人。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"-","text":"在撒母耳下四章四節是米非波設","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":34}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":40}